{"id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md","title":"Continuum Hypothesis (CH)","display":"df-continuum-hypothesis — Continuum Hypothesis (CH)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-continuum-hypothesis","aliases":["92-df-continuum-hypothesis"],"display":"df-continuum-hypothesis — Continuum Hypothesis (CH)","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]","[[92-df-first-order-language]]"],"source":"原书之外的集合论背景；CH 的本地有限成员语言编码","source_status":"外部背景定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-continuum-hypothesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-continuum-hypothesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuum-hypothesis — Continuum Hypothesis (CH)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的集合论背景；CH 的本地有限成员语言编码"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>成员语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Omega},\\operatorname{PowerSet},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Inj},\\operatorname{Bij}\">\\(\\operatorname{Omega},\\operatorname{PowerSet},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Inj},\\operatorname{Bij}\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a>中的有限公式缩写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span> 是定义目标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 在集合论理论的公理添加语境中是它的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists w\\exists p[\\operatorname{Omega}(w)\\land\\operatorname{PowerSet}(w,p)\\land\n\\forall A(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,p)\\to(\\operatorname{Inj}(A,w)\\lor\\operatorname{Bij}(A,p)))],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CH}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CH}_\\in.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists w\\exists p[\\operatorname{Omega}(w)\\land\\operatorname{PowerSet}(w,p)\\land\n\\forall A(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,p)\\to(\\operatorname{Inj}(A,w)\\lor\\operatorname{Bij}(A,p)))],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CH}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CH}_\\in.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 模型中，它说每个实数集要么至多可数，要么与全部实数等势，等价于元语言基数式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1\\)</span>。Cantor 定理排除幂集可数，选择公理提供基数比较，所以这个有限成员语言句子准确表达 CH。\n理论扩张使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\)</span> 及其对象语言否定，不能直接向公式集合加入未经编码的元语言基数等式。独立性及相对一致性是下游定理，不是本定义的条款。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"成员语言的 $\\operatorname{Omega},\\operatorname{PowerSet},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Inj},\\operatorname{Bij}$ 是[[92-df-zfc]]中的有限公式缩写。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Omega},\\operatorname{PowerSet},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Inj},\\operatorname{Bij}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists w\\exists p[\\operatorname{Omega}(w)\\land\\operatorname{PowerSet}(w,p)\\land\n\\forall A(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,p)\\to(\\operatorname{Inj}(A,w)\\lor\\operatorname{Bij}(A,p)))],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CH}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CH}_\\in.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in","display":false}],"bytes":1573,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$、$\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$ 分别见[[92-df-zfc]]和[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]"}],"outgoing":["66c9470f107a6bad","b230b875687723ed"]}